    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAVENSHATTER</strong> is a first-person 3d roguelike set in a distant post-post-post apocalyptic world, beyond matters and means. You are a mass of decaying limbs and microorganisms, emerged from the earth by a brutal, screeching roar. As you roam sandy desolate fields and ancient ruins, your goal is to charge two pillars to activate the great teleporter and escape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/a1d5fe00f59d321454025178d8ba8884.poster.avif?t=1750945694\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/a1d5fe00f59d321454025178d8ba8884.webm?t=1750945694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts from the various creatures you kill to make yourself stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight extreme, brain-melting bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover many possible item combinations and make yourself a horrific walking fortress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill out your logbook and figure out the mysteries of the world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAVENSHATTER</strong> is a first-person 3d roguelike set in a distant post-post-post apocalyptic world, beyond matters and means. You are a mass of decaying limbs and microorganisms, emerged from the earth by a brutal, screeching roar. As you roam sandy desolate fields and ancient ruins, your goal is to charge two pillars to activate the great teleporter and escape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/a1d5fe00f59d321454025178d8ba8884.poster.avif?t=1750945694\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836440/extras/a1d5fe00f59d321454025178d8ba8884.webm?t=1750945694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts from the various creatures you kill to make yourself stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight extreme, brain-melting bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover many possible item combinations and make yourself a horrific walking fortress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill out your logbook and figure out the mysteries of the world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Raw and unfiltered. A small peak into the deep post-post-post-apocalyptic world through the lense of a 3D first-person roguelike. Charge the pillars in a Risk of Rain 2 fashion and exit through the teleporter... beyond... far beyond.",
